//! The PostgreSQL adapter for the store port, with the outbox, the evidence ledger and the local
//! artifact store.
//!
//! * [`pg`]: `PgStore`, the real implementation of `Store` and `Tx` over Diesel and `diesel-async`
//!   (ADR 0007), with row-level security (ADR 0012) and the evidence ledger (ADR 0008).
//! * [`artifact_fs`]: `LocalFsArtifactStore`, the `ArtifactStore` of Slice 1, content addressed on
//!   the local disk (ADR 0008). The one module of this crate that touches the file system.
//! * `schema`: the tables, generated by the Diesel CLI from the migrations. It is not edited.

pub mod artifact_fs;
pub mod pg;
pub mod schema;
